    "text": "(Jones Unknot Detection).\n(a) Is there a nontrivial knot with the same Jones polynomial as the unknot?\n\n(b) Does there exist a nontrivial knot whose colored Jones polynomials are all\ntrivial?\n(c) Is there a nontrivial knot with trivial HOMFLYPT polynomial? (A knot\nwith trivial HOMFLYPT polynomial would have trivial Jones polynomial.)",
